{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122890","id":4376936247,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBOK_Nw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122890","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122890.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122890.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122890","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122890/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122890/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122890/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3b37849360ae5d111dd747334dc44e4019dc8f5b","number":122890,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add GDExtension C# bindings generator to the Mono module","user":{"login":"riyuejiuzhao","id":63774897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzc0ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63774897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao","html_url":"https://github.com/riyuejiuzhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyuejiuzhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Description\n\nThis PR adds a bindings generator for C# that generates C# bindings for classes registered by GDExtension libraries.\n\nKey changes:\n\n- **Bindings generator for GDExtension classes**: Scans classes registered through GDExtension and generates a separate `GDExtension.Bindings` C# assembly that is loaded at runtime, without requiring a rebuild of the GodotSharp assembly.\n- **Editor integration**: Adds a `Project > Tools > C# > Generate C# GDExtension Bindings` menu item to generate the bindings.\n- **Automatic project reference**: The solution's C# projects automatically get a `ProjectReference` to the generated bindings, so users no longer have to manually reference the GDExtension Bindings package.\n- **Wrapper type preservation & versioning**: Preserves C# wrapper types of GDExtension classes, and the GDExtension bindings assembly no longer uses a hard-coded patch version number.\n- **Fixes**: Fixes the GDExtension bindings causing hot reload to fail, and the bindings assembly being loaded too late in some cases.\n- Virtual methods are registered for GDExtension types where applicable, and documentation generation is skipped for GDExtension types for the time being.\n\n### Testing notes\n\n- Squashed from the `godot_gdextension_csharp_bindgen` development branch and rebased onto current `master`.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-27T14:50:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T14:52:15Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T14:52:10Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f60f1796a294b0445ee907c6